==Battleground==
*3 [[Dot Hero|Dot Heroes]] (150%) spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Dot Hero]] (1%) spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Dot Hero|Dot Heroes]] (150%) spawn, delay 50~100 seconds<sup>1,500f~3,000f</sup>.
**3 [[Dot Hero|Dot Heroes]] (150%) spawn, delay 30~36.67 seconds<sup>900f~1,100f</sup>.
**6 [[Dot Hero|Dot Heroes]] (150%) spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win. This stage consist of all Red enemies, so make sure you equip some [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|Anti-Red Cats]], especially since the {{3c}} version of this stage has some form of difficulty, but not much.

